# CrewAI Conventions

When working with CrewAI agents in this project, strictly adhere to the following rules:

1. **Agent Input/Output Contracts**: Do not violate the input and output contracts of the agents. Agents rely on structured data passing between them.
2. **Pydantic & Type Hints**: All data schemas must use Pydantic models (found in `crewai_pydantic_models.py`) and standard Python type hinting to ensure data integrity and validation.
3. **Strict Validation**: Always validate the outputs of the LLMs to ensure they conform to the expected format.
